      "Output ONLY the JSON object — no markdown fences, no prose, no commentary. " +
      "It must be valid JSON parseable by JSON.parse, with at minimum: id, label, __version (1), defaultEnabled (true), catalog (id, icon, title, desc, action), functions (object mapping function name to its full source as a string starting with 'function fnName(...) {'). " +
      "IMPORTANT: format the function source as MULTI-LINE code with real \\n newlines and 2-space indentation between braces. Do NOT minify or join statements onto one line — readability matters."
